  2625   ZZ040-Evaluate-Message      Section.
  2626  *>**********************************
  2627  *>
  2628  *> For PY-PR1 parameter file anfd other using PR-PR1-Status.
  2629  *>
  2630  *>C      copy "FileStat-Msgs-2.cpy" replacing MSG    by WS-Eval-Msg
  2631  *>C                                         STATUS by PY-PR1-Status.
  2632  *> ***************************************************************
  2633  *> ** Author: Gary L. Cutler                                    **
  2634  *> **         CutlerGL@gmail.com                                **
  2635  *> ** Amendments Vincent B. Coen                                **
  2636  *> **         vbcoen@gmail.com                                  **
  2637  *> **                                                           **
  2638  *> ** This copybook defines an EVALUATE statement capable of    **
  2639  *> ** translating two-digit FILE-STATUS codes to a message.     **
  2640  *> **                                                           **
  2641  *> ** Use the REPLACING option to COPY to change the names of   **
  2642  *> ** the MSG and STATUS identifiers to                         **
  2643  *> ** the names your program needs.                             **
  2644  *> Such as replacing STATUS by fs-reply msg by exception-msg.   **
  2645  *>                                                              **
  2646  *> ** chg 09/08/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PYJOURN    19/04/2026  23:25:56:43                                Page   50

  2647  *> ** Chg 11/12/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  2648  *> ** Chg 10/04/25 vbc match all quotes & spacing/layout        **
  2649  *> ** chg to FREE format                                        **
  2650  *> ** Chg 24/08/25 vbc #91 description.                         **
  2651  *> ** Chg 15.11.25 vbc Replace all ' for "                      **
  2652  *> ***************************************************************
  2653  *>
  2654   EVALUATE PY-PR1-Status
  2655   WHEN "00" MOVE "Success                  " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2656   WHEN "02" MOVE "Success Duplicate        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2657   WHEN "04" MOVE "Success Incomplete       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2658   WHEN "05" MOVE "Success Optional, Missing" TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2659   when "06" move "Multiple Records LS      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2660   WHEN "07" MOVE "Success No Unit          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2661   when "09" move "Success LS Bad Data      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2662   WHEN "10" MOVE "End Of File              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2663   WHEN "14" MOVE "Out Of Key Range         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2664   WHEN "21" MOVE "Key Invalid              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2665   WHEN "22" MOVE "Key Exists               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2666   WHEN "23" MOVE "Key Not Exists           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2667   WHEN "24" MOVE "Key Boundary violation   " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2668   WHEN "30" MOVE "Permanent Error          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2669   WHEN "31" MOVE "Inconsistent Filename    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2670   WHEN "34" MOVE "Boundary Violation       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2671   WHEN "35" MOVE "File Not Found           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2672   WHEN "37" MOVE "Permission Denied        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2673   WHEN "38" MOVE "Closed With Lock         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2674   WHEN "39" MOVE "Conflict Attribute       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2675   WHEN "41" MOVE "Already Open             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2676   WHEN "42" MOVE "Not Open                 " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2677   WHEN "43" MOVE "Read Not Done            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2678   WHEN "44" MOVE "Record Overflow          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2679   WHEN "46" MOVE "Read Error               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2680   WHEN "47" MOVE "Input Denied             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2681   WHEN "48" MOVE "Output Denied            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2682   WHEN "49" MOVE "I/O Denied               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2683   WHEN "51" MOVE "Record Locked            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2684   WHEN "52" MOVE "End-Of-Page              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2685   WHEN "57" MOVE "I/O Linage               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2686   WHEN "61" MOVE "File Sharing Failure     " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2687   WHEN "71" MOVE "Bad Character LS         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2688   WHEN "91" MOVE "Feature Not Available    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2689            WHEN OTHER
  2690   MOVE "Unknown File PY-PR1-Status      " TO WS-
  2691  *>
  2692       END-EVALUATE.
  2693
